{"meta":{"ph":"səʊ; NAmE soʊ","pos":"verb","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"to plant or spread seeds in or on the ground 播种；种","ex":[{"s":"Over thousands of years，they began to depend less on ___57___ could be hunted or gathered from the wild，and more on animals they had raised and crops they had sown.","src":"2020浙江7月卷·语法填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"几千年来,他们开始较少依赖 ____57____从野外猎杀或采集, 更多依靠他们饲养的动物和他们种的作物。"}]},{"def":"to introduce or spread feelings or ideas, especially ones that cause trouble 灌输；激起；散布；煽动","ex":[{"s":"These letters obviously helped sow the seeds of love between the two.","src":"人教选必3 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"这些信件显然有助于播下两人之间爱情的种子."},{"s":"Sow the seeds of success today and your harvest will be great tomorrow.","src":"译林选必4 U1","cat":"yilin","t":"播下今天成功的种子,你的收成明天将是伟大的。"}]}]}